{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A book is placed on the right side of the composition. To the left of the book lies a pair of pliers, and a calculator is positioned to the left of the pliers. A black phone is located below the calculator. Additionally, for every white shirt in the scene, it is positioned below the book and has a pair of glasses to its right that is larger than the phone.",
